Comment: 5,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,————————本字幕由三明治擺爛組製作————————
Comment: 5,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Text CN,,0,0,0,,————————正文CN————————
Dialogue: 5,0:00:04.55,0:00:05.96,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這是怎麼了嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:00:05.96,0:00:07.27,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,真少見呢
Dialogue: 5,0:00:07.65,0:00:10.40,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這麼晚了  紬還沒來…
Dialogue: 5,0:00:11.38,0:00:13.35,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,該不會是出什麼事了吧?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:13.35,0:00:14.36,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,比如事故之類的
Dialogue: 5,0:00:14.73,0:00:16.66,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不不  不可能的
Dialogue: 5,0:00:17.13,0:00:21.22,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,難道是紬突然覺得太害羞了
Dialogue: 5,0:00:21.22,0:00:24.00,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,因為和乳依里正式交往了
Dialogue: 5,0:00:24.00,0:00:24.83,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,欸!?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:25.49,0:00:28.63,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我最喜歡羽依里了
Dialogue: 5,0:00:28.92,0:00:32.40,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,怎麼可能啊  畢竟那時候她都說最喜歡我了…
Dialogue: 5,0:00:32.90,0:00:33.40,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,啊!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:34.46,0:00:35.34,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,果然呢
Dialogue: 5,0:00:36.36,0:00:37.78,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,抱歉!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:37.78,0:00:41.77,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我本打算和紬一起去跟靜久匯報的
Dialogue: 5,0:00:41.77,0:00:44.68,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你們開始交往  我很高興呢
Dialogue: 5,0:00:45.00,0:00:47.73,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,請務必讓紬幸福啊
Dialogue: 5,0:00:48.67,0:00:49.61,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,當然了
Dialogue: 5,0:00:49.61,0:00:51.89,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不過有點失望呢
Dialogue: 5,0:00:51.89,0:00:57.07,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,接下來不能獨占馬上發育歐派的紬了…
Dialogue: 5,0:00:57.07,0:00:58.15,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,欸!?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:58.15,0:01:01.82,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不  不… 紬的歐派是紬的
Dialogue: 5,0:01:01.82,0:01:03.58,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不屬於任何人…
Dialogue: 5,0:01:03.58,0:01:07.08,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬那傢伙或許還在睡覺吧
Dialogue: 5,0:01:07.08,0:01:10.02,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,真沒辦法  我去叫她吧
Dialogue: 5,0:01:11.61,0:01:15.13,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬說她住在燈塔  那她真正的家在哪
Dialogue: 5,0:01:15.36,0:01:15.74,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 5,0:01:16.43,0:01:17.97,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我也不知道啊
Dialogue: 5,0:01:19.05,0:01:23.68,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,畢竟每次跟紬是在這裡見面和道別
Dialogue: 5,0:01:24.28,0:01:26.80,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,每次都是紬目送我
Dialogue: 5,0:01:34.02,0:01:35.04,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:37.24,0:01:38.00,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Comment: 4,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,————————正文JP————————
Dialogue: 4,0:00:04.55,0:00:05.96,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,どうしたんだろう
Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.96,0:00:07.27,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,珍しいわね
Dialogue: 4,0:00:07.65,0:00:10.40,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬がこんな時間になっても来ないなんて…
Dialogue: 4,0:00:11.38,0:00:13.35,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,何かあったのかな？
Dialogue: 4,0:00:13.35,0:00:14.36,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,事故とか…
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.73,0:00:16.66,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,いやいや　まさかな
Dialogue: 4,0:00:17.13,0:00:21.22,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,もしかしたら紬　急に恥ずかしくなったのかも
Dialogue: 4,0:00:21.22,0:00:24.00,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,正式にパイリくんとつきあうことになって…
Dialogue: 4,0:00:24.00,0:00:24.83,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,えっ!?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:25.49,0:00:28.63,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ハイリさんのことが　大好きです
Dialogue: 4,0:00:28.92,0:00:32.40,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そんな!?　だってあのときはちゃんと好きだって…
Dialogue: 4,0:00:32.90,0:00:33.40,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あっ！
Dialogue: 4,0:00:34.46,0:00:35.34,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,やっぱり
Dialogue: 4,0:00:36.36,0:00:37.78,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ごめん！
Dialogue: 4,0:00:37.78,0:00:41.77,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,静久には2人そろってからちゃんと報告しようと思ってて
Dialogue: 4,0:00:41.77,0:00:44.68,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,2人がそうなってくれてすごくうれしいわ！
Dialogue: 4,0:00:45.00,0:00:47.73,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬のこと　幸せにしてあげてね！
Dialogue: 4,0:00:48.67,0:00:49.61,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,もちろん
Dialogue: 4,0:00:49.61,0:00:51.89,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,でも残念ね
Dialogue: 4,0:00:51.89,0:00:57.07,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,これから育つ紬のおっぱいが　私だけのものじゃなくなっちゃうなんて…
Dialogue: 4,0:00:57.07,0:00:58.15,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,えっ!?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:58.15,0:01:01.82,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,い　いや…　紬のおっぱいは紬のものだし
Dialogue: 4,0:01:01.82,0:01:03.58,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,誰のものでも…
Dialogue: 4,0:01:03.58,0:01:07.08,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,つ…　紬のやつまだ寝てるのかもな
Dialogue: 4,0:01:07.08,0:01:10.02,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,しようがない　こっちから迎えに行くか
Dialogue: 4,0:01:11.61,0:01:15.13,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬って灯台に住んでるって言ってたけど　本当の家は？
Dialogue: 4,0:01:15.36,0:01:15.74,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,えっ…
Dialogue: 4,0:01:16.43,0:01:17.97,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,私知らないわよ
Dialogue: 4,0:01:19.05,0:01:23.68,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,だって　紬とはいつもここで会ってここで別れて
Dialogue: 4,0:01:24.28,0:01:26.80,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,いつも紬が見送ってくれてたから
Dialogue: 4,0:01:34.02,0:01:35.04,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ハイリくん？
Dialogue: 4,0:01:37.24,0:01:38.00,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,なんでもない
Comment: 5,0:02:20.99,0:02:20.99,Text CN,,0,0,0,,————————正文CN  OP後————————
Dialogue: 5,0:03:10.35,0:03:11.78,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,打擾一下
Dialogue: 5,0:03:12.27,0:03:13.32,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,來了來了
Dialogue: 5,0:03:13.61,0:03:14.98,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我有事想問一下
Dialogue: 5,0:03:14.98,0:03:17.17,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,啊  來得正好
Dialogue: 5,0:03:19.04,0:03:19.79,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,給
Dialogue: 5,0:03:19.79,0:03:21.01,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你訂的東西
Dialogue: 5,0:03:22.13,0:03:25.05,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,送達速度比預想的快
Dialogue: 5,0:03:25.45,0:03:27.04,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這就是愛的力量吧
Dialogue: 5,0:03:30.93,0:03:33.48,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,或許是遭遇神隱了
Dialogue: 5,0:03:33.48,0:03:35.94,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,神隱… 嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:03:36.36,0:03:38.60,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那是幾十年前的事了
Dialogue: 5,0:03:38.60,0:03:40.69,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那件事當時鬧得沸沸揚揚
Dialogue: 5,0:03:41.10,0:03:43.86,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,據說有一個金髮女孩突然不見了
Dialogue: 5,0:03:44.96,0:03:46.20,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,金髮…
Dialogue: 5,0:03:46.67,0:03:50.84,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,她的父母和島民將這個島找了個遍
Dialogue: 5,0:03:50.84,0:03:52.98,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,960)}結果她還是沒有回來
Dialogue: 5,0:03:53.47,0:03:59.47,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那時候  也有個男人像你一樣  也在拚命找那個女孩
Dialogue: 5,0:03:59.47,0:04:01.97,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,好像那個男人是管理燈塔的
Dialogue: 5,0:04:01.97,0:04:03.64,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,管理燈塔…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:03.64,0:04:07.51,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,現在還有誰認識當時遭遇神隱的女孩嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:04:07.51,0:04:08.76,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,沒有了
Dialogue: 5,0:04:08.76,0:04:10.23,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,都不在了
Dialogue: 5,0:04:10.23,0:04:12.06,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,最後一個認識她的
Dialogue: 5,0:04:12.74,0:04:15.90,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,是前不久去世的加藤女士
Dialogue: 5,0:04:17.26,0:04:19.86,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,好像問到了些不得了的消息呢
Dialogue: 5,0:04:20.24,0:04:21.66,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,竟然是神隱…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:25.94,0:04:26.78,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,乳依里?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:27.45,0:04:29.42,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你能看看這個嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:04:31.71,0:04:32.64,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:33.40,0:04:34.58,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,但這是…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:34.95,0:04:36.00,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 5,0:04:36.56,0:04:37.78,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這不對吧?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:38.49,0:04:39.94,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,因為這照片這麼老了
Dialogue: 5,0:04:40.55,0:04:42.04,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你說是吧  羽依里
Dialogue: 5,0:04:42.83,0:04:44.25,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我不知道…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:44.25,0:04:44.97,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:45.84,0:04:47.38,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,無論如何我都很在意
Dialogue: 5,0:04:52.76,0:04:55.23,Text CN - Tsumugi,,1100,0,0,,這個地方  總感覺在哪見過…
Dialogue: 5,0:04:57.60,0:04:59.15,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你看這裡
Dialogue: 5,0:04:59.58,0:05:01.19,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,之前好像在哪見過…
Dialogue: 5,0:05:02.86,0:05:05.54,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,「這裡是掌權者的家」
Dialogue: 5,0:05:05.54,0:05:07.58,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,「現在已經沒人住了」
Dialogue: 5,0:05:08.20,0:05:10.70,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,難道這裡是… 紬的家?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:14.03,0:05:15.87,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,打擾了
Dialogue: 5,0:05:20.35,0:05:21.90,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,看著沒人在的樣子
Dialogue: 5,0:05:22.41,0:05:23.58,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,喂!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:23.58,0:05:24.70,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:31.52,0:05:33.56,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,看著像是女孩子的房間呢
Dialogue: 5,0:05:43.91,0:05:45.72,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里  快看這個!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:48.20,0:05:49.36,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬…
Dialogue: 5,0:05:50.63,0:05:53.95,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「我從今天起  要在島上的學校學習了」
Dialogue: 5,0:05:54.42,0:05:58.96,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「大家見到我後  都紛紛議論起我瞳色和髮色」
Dialogue: 5,0:05:58.96,0:06:02.66,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「所以  我的朋友只有布偶」
Dialogue: 5,0:06:03.31,0:06:04.42,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,布偶…
Dialogue: 5,0:06:06.40,0:06:07.38,Text CN - Tsumugi,,700,0,0,,難道那些…
Dialogue: 5,0:06:08.17,0:06:11.72,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「今天大家也不和我說話」
Dialogue: 5,0:06:11.72,0:06:13.81,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「大概是他們有點怕我吧」
Dialogue: 5,0:06:14.23,0:06:16.93,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「覺得我是生剝鬼之類的」
Dialogue: 5,0:06:17.29,0:06:20.85,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,700,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「所以  我想鼓起勇氣跟大家搭話」
Dialogue: 5,0:06:22.50,0:06:24.02,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「要像生剝鬼一樣」
Dialogue: 5,0:06:24.02,0:06:26.38,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「愛哭的孩子在哪裡」
Dialogue: 5,0:06:26.38,0:06:28.40,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「壞孩子在哪裡」
Dialogue: 5,0:06:28.40,0:06:31.94,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「不聽爸媽話的孩子在哪裡」
Dialogue: 5,0:06:39.51,0:06:41.17,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「我搞砸了」
Dialogue: 5,0:06:57.76,0:07:01.15,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「終於交到朋友了  她的名字叫加藤」
Dialogue: 5,0:07:01.15,0:07:05.15,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「對布偶很感興趣  我覺得非常開心」
Dialogue: 5,0:07:05.64,0:07:07.53,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬  太好了呢
Dialogue: 5,0:07:07.91,0:07:11.30,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,之後交到了很多朋友  也適應了島上的生活
Dialogue: 5,0:07:11.30,0:07:13.08,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,感覺每天都過得很開心呢
Dialogue: 5,0:07:14.49,0:07:15.26,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬
Dialogue: 5,0:07:15.60,0:07:17.68,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,好像和管理燈塔的私奔了
Dialogue: 5,0:07:17.68,0:07:18.66,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,欸——!?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:29.23,0:07:33.31,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「我決定和他一起離開這座島」
Dialogue: 5,0:07:33.31,0:07:35.18,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「我們約好今天在燈塔碰面」
Dialogue: 5,0:07:35.92,0:07:38.92,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「爸爸媽媽  對不起」
Dialogue: 5,0:07:38.92,0:07:41.81,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「感謝島上的大家  一直以來對我的照顧」
Dialogue: 5,0:07:42.47,0:07:43.94,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「我最愛你們了」
Dialogue: 5,0:07:45.35,0:07:47.02,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,難不成你嫉妒了?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:47.02,0:07:48.07,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,嫉妒了
Dialogue: 5,0:07:48.07,0:07:49.56,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,真乾脆呢
Dialogue: 5,0:07:49.56,0:07:52.34,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不 不過  這本日記裡寫的
Dialogue: 5,0:07:52.34,0:07:54.16,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,都是幾十年前的事了
Dialogue: 5,0:07:54.91,0:07:56.12,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,私奔…
Dialogue: 5,0:07:57.48,0:08:00.84,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,難道神隱指的就是這個嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:08:00.84,0:08:02.68,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不  應該不是
Dialogue: 5,0:08:02.68,0:08:05.43,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,小賣鋪的婆婆不是說了嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:08:05.43,0:08:09.27,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,管理燈塔的人也在找消失的女孩
Dialogue: 5,0:08:09.27,0:08:11.66,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,也就是說  真的遭遇神隱了?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:13.34,0:08:14.08,Text CN - Tsumugi,,800,0,0,,難道…
Dialogue: 5,0:08:15.24,0:08:16.60,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我們的紬也是?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:21.01,0:08:23.04,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這本日記還有後續
Dialogue: 5,0:08:28.78,0:08:30.28,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這是什麼…
Dialogue: 5,0:08:38.30,0:08:39.16,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這是
Dialogue: 5,0:08:46.62,0:08:48.63,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我有點害怕…
Dialogue: 5,0:08:49.35,0:08:50.24,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,靜久
Dialogue: 5,0:08:50.98,0:08:54.76,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我們再越找越查下去
Dialogue: 5,0:08:55.42,0:08:58.60,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我就越怕再也見不到紬了…
Dialogue: 5,0:09:00.57,0:09:02.14,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  在這裡解散吧
Dialogue: 5,0:09:02.50,0:09:03.49,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:03.49,0:09:05.84,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我想去一個地方
Dialogue: 5,0:09:22.11,0:09:24.04,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你們也在等著紬嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:09:24.89,0:09:25.60,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 5,0:09:26.05,0:09:28.12,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我目前能做的事
Dialogue: 5,0:09:28.12,0:09:31.28,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,就只有在這裡等著紬回來了
Dialogue: 5,0:09:31.96,0:09:32.55,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 5,0:09:33.40,0:09:34.00,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 5,0:09:34.91,0:09:35.82,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬…
Dialogue: 5,0:09:38.20,0:09:38.54,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 5,0:09:38.88,0:09:39.41,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}欸!?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:49.96,0:09:50.74,Text CN,,0,0,0,,這裡是…
Dialogue: 5,0:09:52.56,0:09:55.08,Text CN,,0,0,0,,並不是紬的房間…
Dialogue: 5,0:10:02.19,0:10:03.74,Text CN,,0,0,0,,這是… 什麼?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:05.08,0:10:06.82,Text CN,,0,0,0,,這  這到底是哪裡!?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:11.48,0:10:12.65,Text CN,,0,0,0,,門打不開?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:12.65,0:10:13.38,Text CN,,0,0,0,,可惡!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:25.13,0:10:25.80,Text CN,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 5,0:10:26.59,0:10:27.96,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我明明在往上走啊
Dialogue: 5,0:10:37.96,0:10:39.49,Text CN,,0,0,0,,這什麼情況
Dialogue: 5,0:10:39.49,0:10:40.50,Text CN,,0,0,0,,您是哪位?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:45.43,0:10:46.15,Text CN,,0,0,0,,請問…
Dialogue: 5,0:10:47.50,0:10:48.75,Text CN,,0,0,0,,紬!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:48.75,0:10:49.93,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你到底跑哪去了
Dialogue: 5,0:10:49.93,0:10:51.62,Text CN,,0,0,0,,擔心死我了
Dialogue: 5,0:10:51.62,0:10:54.17,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我一直待在這裡啊
Dialogue: 5,0:10:54.17,0:10:55.56,Text CN,,0,0,0,,待在這裡?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:55.56,0:10:59.05,Text CN,,0,0,0,,但我找了你很久  完全找不到…
Dialogue: 5,0:11:00.87,0:11:03.09,Text CN,,0,0,0,,你是紬… 對吧?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:03.09,0:11:07.29,Text CN,,0,0,0,,是的  我確實是紬·文德斯
Dialogue: 5,0:11:14.42,0:11:16.56,Text CN,,0,0,0,,愛哭的孩子在哪裡
Dialogue: 5,0:11:17.19,0:11:19.32,Text CN,,0,0,0,,壞孩子在哪裡
Dialogue: 5,0:11:19.32,0:11:22.84,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不聽爸媽話的孩子在哪裡
Dialogue: 5,0:11:22.84,0:11:26.12,Text CN,,0,0,0,,您  您怎麼知道我招牌的自我介紹
Dialogue: 5,0:11:26.72,0:11:27.66,Text CN,,0,0,0,,騙人的吧…
Dialogue: 5,0:11:28.84,0:11:31.06,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我也… 神隱了?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:38.84,0:11:40.84,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我想回去!!!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:41.26,0:11:45.18,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我超級無敵想回去啊啊啊!!!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:45.54,0:11:47.57,Text CN,,0,0,0,,這樣真的能回去嗎?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:47.57,0:11:50.56,Text CN,,0,0,0,,其他人好像是這樣回去的
Dialogue: 5,0:11:50.56,0:11:54.76,Text CN,,0,0,0,,因為我也沒回去過  所以不知道行不行
Dialogue: 5,0:11:56.36,0:11:57.90,Text CN,,0,0,0,,很遺憾
Dialogue: 5,0:11:57.90,0:12:02.04,Text CN,,0,0,0,,人被某種東西困住的話  永遠無法回去
Dialogue: 5,0:12:02.90,0:12:04.16,Text CN,,0,0,0,,直至永恆
Dialogue: 5,0:12:04.62,0:12:09.24,Text CN,,0,0,0,,被困在這裡  時間長到忘記自己為何會被困住
Dialogue: 5,0:12:09.24,0:12:10.83,Text CN,,0,0,0,,被困在這裡…
Dialogue: 5,0:12:11.34,0:12:12.52,Text CN,,0,0,0,,所以你也…
Dialogue: 5,0:12:15.02,0:12:16.86,Text CN,,0,0,0,,真的有這麼像嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:12:17.50,0:12:19.78,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我和那位…
Dialogue: 5,0:12:19.78,0:12:20.84,Text CN,,0,0,0,,紬小姐?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:21.75,0:12:22.35,Text CN,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 5,0:12:23.02,0:12:25.64,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不能說像  只能說完全一致
Dialogue: 5,0:12:25.64,0:12:28.28,Text CN,,0,0,0,,不過除了氣質截然不同
Dialogue: 5,0:12:28.28,0:12:31.82,Text CN,,0,0,0,,她活潑開朗  一旦下定決心做某事就會全力以赴
Dialogue: 5,0:12:31.82,0:12:33.96,Text CN,,0,0,0,,所以我總是移不開目光
Dialogue: 5,0:12:33.96,0:12:35.36,Text CN,,0,0,0,,這樣啊…
Dialogue: 5,0:12:35.36,0:12:37.27,Text CN,,0,0,0,,希望您能早日回去
Dialogue: 5,0:12:40.01,0:12:42.64,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我很理解鷹原先生的心情
Dialogue: 5,0:12:43.72,0:12:49.98,Text CN,,0,0,0,,因為我也和戀人  和最喜歡的朋友分開了很久很久
Dialogue: 5,0:12:49.98,0:12:51.94,Text CN,,0,0,0,,和你私奔的那位嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:12:54.36,0:12:57.83,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我那時未能做出決定
Dialogue: 5,0:12:59.18,0:13:01.96,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我那時突然感到害怕了
Dialogue: 5,0:13:06.39,0:13:08.38,Text CN,,0,0,0,,為了能和心愛之人在一起
Dialogue: 5,0:13:08.75,0:13:11.27,Text CN,,0,0,0,,我要將親人和島上的朋友全部捨棄
Dialogue: 5,0:13:11.27,0:13:14.32,Text CN,,0,0,0,,明明早已下定決心
Dialogue: 5,0:13:15.32,0:13:16.65,Text CN,,0,0,0,,但我還是猶豫了
Dialogue: 5,0:13:17.81,0:13:19.90,Text CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,920)}最後未能做出決定
Dialogue: 5,0:13:24.28,0:13:27.52,Text CN,,0,0,0,,當回過神時  就已經在這裡了
Dialogue: 5,0:13:28.21,0:13:32.14,Text CN,,0,0,0,,即便到了現在  我仍還在猶豫
Dialogue: 5,0:13:32.14,0:13:33.20,Text CN,,0,0,0,,紬小姐…
Dialogue: 5,0:13:33.52,0:13:38.24,Text CN,,0,0,0,,但鷹原先生是為了尋找想見的人  才誤入這裡的吧
Dialogue: 5,0:13:38.24,0:13:41.44,Text CN,,0,0,0,,那麼  只要內心強烈地思念著她
Dialogue: 5,0:13:41.44,0:13:43.98,Text CN,,0,0,0,,就一定能回到原來的世界
Dialogue: 5,0:13:44.79,0:13:46.62,Text CN,,0,0,0,,強烈地思念著…
Dialogue: 5,0:13:47.09,0:13:50.30,Text CN,,0,0,0,,請相信著  相信你的戀人
Dialogue: 5,0:13:52.15,0:13:53.26,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\t(200,600,\shad3)\3c&HD2811E&\t(200,600,\3c&H41B931&)}沒錯
Dialogue: 5,0:13:53.68,0:13:55.64,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,無論紬是什麼人
Dialogue: 5,0:13:55.99,0:13:57.69,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,無論紬有什麼過去
Dialogue: 5,0:13:58.03,0:13:59.72,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,現在都不重要了
Dialogue: 5,0:14:00.23,0:14:02.69,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,現在的我只想見到紬
Dialogue: 5,0:14:03.43,0:14:05.03,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,現在只想見到她的笑容
Dialogue: 5,0:14:05.60,0:14:07.38,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,現在只想聽她哼唱的歌
Dialogue: 5,0:14:12.62,0:14:14.23,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這首歌…
Dialogue: 5,0:14:15.18,0:14:16.16,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,好懷念啊
Dialogue: 5,0:14:22.01,0:14:22.74,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,風…
Dialogue: 5,0:14:24.80,0:14:26.80,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬小姐  或許有出口!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:28.48,0:14:30.90,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,和仍在猶豫的我一起去
Dialogue: 5,0:14:30.90,0:14:33.26,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,出口肯定會消失的
Dialogue: 5,0:14:33.70,0:14:35.91,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,鷹原先生您自己去吧
Dialogue: 5,0:14:35.91,0:14:36.60,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,可是!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:41.15,0:14:44.77,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,請您一定要好好珍惜紬小姐
Dialogue: 5,0:14:47.26,0:14:47.84,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 5,0:14:48.41,0:14:49.04,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 5,0:14:51.82,0:14:54.28,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你在那種地方做什麼呢~
Dialogue: 5,0:14:54.68,0:14:57.11,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,在找東~西~
Dialogue: 5,0:14:57.11,0:14:59.04,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,在找什麼呢~?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:59.43,0:15:01.42,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,在找自己~
Dialogue: 5,0:15:01.60,0:15:02.34,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬…
Dialogue: 5,0:15:03.23,0:15:05.40,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你所要找尋的自己
Dialogue: 5,0:15:06.18,0:15:06.90,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,難道就是…
Dialogue: 5,0:15:16.74,0:15:17.64,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 5,0:15:35.42,0:15:37.67,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,品刻洋芋片是無敵的
Dialogue: 5,0:15:37.67,0:15:38.36,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,對吧
Dialogue: 5,0:15:40.04,0:15:40.86,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬…
Dialogue: 5,0:15:44.28,0:15:45.16,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:45.66,0:15:46.56,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里!!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:47.20,0:15:48.21,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里!!!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:51.30,0:15:52.36,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:56.34,0:15:57.28,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,真是的!!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:57.28,0:15:59.00,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你到底去哪了!?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:59.00,0:16:00.18,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,靜久…
Dialogue: 5,0:16:00.84,0:16:02.89,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬消失後
Dialogue: 5,0:16:02.89,0:16:05.03,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,如果連你也消失了
Dialogue: 5,0:16:05.03,0:16:07.65,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我該怎麼辦才好啊!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:08.77,0:16:09.60,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,抱歉…
Dialogue: 5,0:16:11.49,0:16:12.10,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬呢!?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:13.95,0:16:15.42,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽  羽依里…
Dialogue: 5,0:16:17.34,0:16:18.80,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,太好了…
Dialogue: 5,0:16:18.80,0:16:22.13,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,真是太好了  羽依里…
Dialogue: 5,0:16:22.13,0:16:23.06,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬…
Dialogue: 5,0:16:24.59,0:16:27.17,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我和羽依里分開後第二天的事
Dialogue: 5,0:16:27.50,0:16:31.98,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我想著紬也許會回來  就一直在燈塔前等著
Dialogue: 5,0:16:36.15,0:16:37.29,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,靜久
Dialogue: 5,0:16:37.90,0:16:38.71,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 5,0:16:39.14,0:16:39.70,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾!?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:40.16,0:16:40.78,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:40.78,0:16:41.20,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬!!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:41.20,0:16:41.64,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬!!!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:41.64,0:16:43.52,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬!!!!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:44.41,0:16:49.48,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,但是  在紬回來後  這次連你也消失了
Dialogue: 5,0:16:50.09,0:16:51.54,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,真的擔心死我了
Dialogue: 5,0:16:52.16,0:16:52.92,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,抱歉…
Dialogue: 5,0:16:54.33,0:16:56.86,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,真是… 太好了
Dialogue: 5,0:16:57.37,0:16:58.20,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬…
Dialogue: 5,0:16:59.50,0:17:00.34,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:01.57,0:17:02.79,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬…
Dialogue: 5,0:17:02.79,0:17:04.76,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不… 不行
Dialogue: 5,0:17:04.76,0:17:08.18,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,眼淚鼻涕什麼的  會沾到你身上的
Dialogue: 5,0:17:09.07,0:17:10.09,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 5,0:17:13.39,0:17:14.34,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那麼
Dialogue: 5,0:17:14.34,0:17:17.34,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,請再多抱我一會
Dialogue: 5,0:17:17.83,0:17:20.22,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你們兩個真是的…
Dialogue: 5,0:17:20.63,0:17:21.64,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你們兩個…
Dialogue: 5,0:17:30.84,0:17:33.57,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我消失了一整天?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:33.57,0:17:34.81,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 5,0:17:34.81,0:17:36.75,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你到底去哪裡了
Dialogue: 5,0:17:36.75,0:17:37.91,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,去哪了…
Dialogue: 5,0:17:37.91,0:17:39.03,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這個…
Dialogue: 5,0:17:42.08,0:17:44.16,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我不記得了…
Dialogue: 5,0:17:44.16,0:17:45.07,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:45.07,0:17:46.08,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:46.08,0:17:47.22,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,是真的
Dialogue: 5,0:17:48.15,0:17:49.50,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我全都不記得了
Dialogue: 5,0:17:52.99,0:17:53.72,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:59.30,0:18:01.68,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不記得就沒辦法了
Dialogue: 5,0:18:04.25,0:18:05.43,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,歡迎回來
Dialogue: 5,0:18:05.43,0:18:06.30,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 5,0:18:07.25,0:18:09.39,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,真的非常抱歉
Dialogue: 5,0:18:09.39,0:18:10.94,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,非常抱歉
Dialogue: 5,0:18:11.60,0:18:14.14,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,雖然我很擔心
Dialogue: 5,0:18:14.14,0:18:15.68,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,但你沒事就好
Dialogue: 5,0:18:17.41,0:18:18.26,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 5,0:18:18.26,0:18:19.20,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,小海呢?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:19.51,0:18:22.00,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,擔心到累得睡著了
Dialogue: 5,0:18:22.00,0:18:24.20,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,明天要好好跟她道歉哦
Dialogue: 5,0:18:24.20,0:18:25.40,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 5,0:18:25.40,0:18:28.08,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,小紬  今天很晚了
Dialogue: 5,0:18:28.08,0:18:29.40,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,乾脆就住我家吧?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:30.73,0:18:31.86,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾…
Dialogue: 5,0:18:42.60,0:18:43.50,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里
Dialogue: 5,0:18:44.73,0:18:46.20,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我可以進來嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:18:47.80,0:18:48.28,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 5,0:18:48.86,0:18:49.44,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,請進
Dialogue: 5,0:18:54.81,0:18:57.60,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,可以和你聊聊嗎?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:02.62,0:19:03.34,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 5,0:19:04.06,0:19:07.28,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我之前說我要回去了
Dialogue: 5,0:19:07.96,0:19:12.82,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那個的意思並不是回故鄉…
Dialogue: 5,0:19:13.58,0:19:14.48,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 5,0:19:15.72,0:19:16.62,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這個…
Dialogue: 5,0:19:17.32,0:19:19.40,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆  姆啾…
Dialogue: 5,0:19:19.90,0:19:21.00,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,聽我說  紬
Dialogue: 5,0:19:21.51,0:19:25.08,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這件事說不說都沒關係的
Dialogue: 5,0:19:26.44,0:19:27.92,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我已經決定了
Dialogue: 5,0:19:27.92,0:19:31.72,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,直到最後一刻  都會陪在你身邊
Dialogue: 5,0:19:31.72,0:19:33.06,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我已下定決心
Dialogue: 5,0:19:33.38,0:19:37.78,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,無論你說或不說  我都會一直陪在你身邊
Dialogue: 5,0:19:39.79,0:19:41.07,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里…
Dialogue: 5,0:19:45.51,0:19:49.11,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我想一直和你在一起
Dialogue: 5,0:19:49.11,0:19:50.76,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,直到最後
Dialogue: 5,0:19:50.76,0:19:51.96,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 5,0:19:51.96,0:19:52.70,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 5,0:19:54.74,0:19:57.96,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我也有一件事必須要告訴紬
Dialogue: 5,0:19:58.46,0:20:01.36,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我見到紬·文德斯小姐了
Dialogue: 5,0:20:02.48,0:20:04.96,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,雖然我不記得我去了哪裡
Dialogue: 5,0:20:05.62,0:20:06.98,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,但我還記得她
Dialogue: 5,0:20:07.82,0:20:09.72,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我認為我不能忘記她
Dialogue: 5,0:20:10.22,0:20:11.18,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 5,0:20:11.18,0:20:14.17,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,小紬她還好嗎?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:14.17,0:20:14.62,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 5,0:20:15.03,0:20:16.47,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,她還挺有精神的
Dialogue: 5,0:20:16.47,0:20:17.77,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 5,0:20:17.77,0:20:18.90,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 5,0:20:20.04,0:20:20.90,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我想問
Dialogue: 5,0:20:21.18,0:20:25.32,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬一直在尋找的「自己」就是她嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:20:25.32,0:20:26.12,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 5,0:20:26.12,0:20:27.41,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,就是小紬
Dialogue: 5,0:20:29.32,0:20:32.66,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,暑假一結束就要去找她了嗎
Dialogue: 5,0:20:32.94,0:20:34.32,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,是這樣…
Dialogue: 5,0:20:34.32,0:20:37.06,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,多虧了羽依里找到了小紬
Dialogue: 5,0:20:37.06,0:20:41.56,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我或許能回到小紬的身邊了
Dialogue: 5,0:20:41.56,0:20:44.30,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,她應該非常寂寞了吧
Dialogue: 5,0:20:44.30,0:20:45.30,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 5,0:20:46.81,0:20:47.78,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,麻煩了啊…
Dialogue: 5,0:20:49.21,0:20:51.81,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那樣的話  我也寂寞了
Dialogue: 5,0:20:53.42,0:20:54.96,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,姆啾~
Dialogue: 5,0:20:54.96,0:20:57.52,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,請  請別說這麼任性的話
Dialogue: 5,0:20:57.52,0:20:59.69,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我也會很寂寞的
Dialogue: 5,0:20:59.69,0:21:04.00,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,你這麼一說  我真的會感到很為難的
Dialogue: 5,0:21:05.29,0:21:06.66,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,啊 對了
Dialogue: 5,0:21:08.80,0:21:09.99,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,這個送給你
Dialogue: 5,0:21:13.76,0:21:15.75,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,靜久說
Dialogue: 5,0:21:15.75,0:21:19.71,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,想對心愛之人傳達心意  送禮物是最好的方式
Dialogue: 5,0:21:19.71,0:21:22.25,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,不愧是靜久呢
Dialogue: 5,0:21:22.25,0:21:24.68,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,那個  我可以戴上嗎?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:24.68,0:21:25.30,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,當然了
Dialogue: 5,0:21:33.00,0:21:34.02,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:35.27,0:21:36.18,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,非常美
Dialogue: 5,0:21:38.08,0:21:42.44,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里的心意  確確實實傳達給我了
Dialogue: 5,0:22:01.90,0:22:05.50,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,距離 8 月 31 日  還剩一週時間
Dialogue: 5,0:22:06.42,0:22:09.82,Text CN - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,我們的暑假  即將結束了
Comment: 4,0:02:20.99,0:02:20.99,Text CN,,0,0,0,,————————正文JP  OP後————————
Dialogue: 4,0:03:10.35,0:03:11.78,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ごめんくださ～い
Dialogue: 4,0:03:12.27,0:03:13.32,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,はいはい
Dialogue: 4,0:03:13.61,0:03:14.98,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ちょっと聞きたいことが
Dialogue: 4,0:03:14.98,0:03:17.17,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,おお　ええところに来よった
Dialogue: 4,0:03:19.04,0:03:19.79,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ほい
Dialogue: 4,0:03:19.79,0:03:21.01,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,例のもんじゃて
Dialogue: 4,0:03:22.13,0:03:25.05,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,思いのほか早く届いての
Dialogue: 4,0:03:25.45,0:03:27.04,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,愛の力じゃな
Dialogue: 4,0:03:30.93,0:03:33.48,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,神隠しからもしれんのう
Dialogue: 4,0:03:33.48,0:03:35.94,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,神隠し…　ですか
Dialogue: 4,0:03:36.36,0:03:38.60,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,もう何十年前かのう
Dialogue: 4,0:03:38.60,0:03:40.69,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あのときも大騒ぎじゃった
Dialogue: 4,0:03:41.10,0:03:43.86,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,金髪の女の子がいなくなったって
Dialogue: 4,0:03:44.96,0:03:46.20,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,金髪の…
Dialogue: 4,0:03:46.67,0:03:50.84,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,両親も島のみんなも あちこち捜し回ったが
Dialogue: 4,0:03:50.84,0:03:52.98,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,960)}結局帰ってこなんだ
Dialogue: 4,0:03:53.47,0:03:59.47,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あのときも　今のお前さんみたいに　必死に捜しとったのがいたのう
Dialogue: 4,0:03:59.47,0:04:01.97,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ありゃ灯台守の男じゃったか
Dialogue: 4,0:04:01.97,0:04:03.64,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,燈台守…
Dialogue: 4,0:04:03.64,0:04:07.51,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,その神隠しにあった子の知り合いって誰かいますか？
Dialogue: 4,0:04:07.51,0:04:08.76,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,いいや
Dialogue: 4,0:04:08.76,0:04:10.23,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,もうおらん
Dialogue: 4,0:04:10.23,0:04:12.06,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,その子のことを知る人は
Dialogue: 4,0:04:12.74,0:04:15.90,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,この前亡くなった加藤さんが最後じゃったよ
Dialogue: 4,0:04:17.26,0:04:19.86,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,なんかすごい話聞いちゃったわね
Dialogue: 4,0:04:20.24,0:04:21.66,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,神隠しだなんて…
Dialogue: 4,0:04:25.94,0:04:26.78,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,パイリくん？
Dialogue: 4,0:04:27.45,0:04:29.42,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,これ…　見てくれないか
Dialogue: 4,0:04:31.71,0:04:32.64,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬？
Dialogue: 4,0:04:33.40,0:04:34.58,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,でもこれって…
Dialogue: 4,0:04:34.95,0:04:36.00,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ちょっと待って…
Dialogue: 4,0:04:36.56,0:04:37.78,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,違うわよね？
Dialogue: 4,0:04:38.49,0:04:39.94,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,だってこんな古い写真
Dialogue: 4,0:04:40.55,0:04:42.04,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ねぇ　ハイリくん！
Dialogue: 4,0:04:42.83,0:04:44.25,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,わからない…
Dialogue: 4,0:04:44.25,0:04:44.97,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,でも…
Dialogue: 4,0:04:45.84,0:04:47.38,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,どうしても気になるんだ
Dialogue: 4,0:04:52.76,0:04:55.23,Text JP - Tsumugi,,1100,0,0,,これ　どこかで見たような…
Dialogue: 4,0:04:57.60,0:04:59.15,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ほら　これ
Dialogue: 4,0:04:59.58,0:05:01.19,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,前にどこかで…
Dialogue: 4,0:05:02.86,0:05:05.54,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,権力者さんのお家です
Dialogue: 4,0:05:05.54,0:05:07.58,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,今は誰も住んでいません
Dialogue: 4,0:05:08.20,0:05:10.70,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ここが…　紬の家？
Dialogue: 4,0:05:14.03,0:05:15.87,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,おじゃましま～す
Dialogue: 4,0:05:20.35,0:05:21.90,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,誰もいないのかしら
Dialogue: 4,0:05:22.41,0:05:23.58,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,お～い！
Dialogue: 4,0:05:23.58,0:05:24.70,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬！
Dialogue: 4,0:05:31.52,0:05:33.56,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,女の子の部屋みたいね
Dialogue: 4,0:05:43.91,0:05:45.72,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ハイリくん　これ！
Dialogue: 4,0:05:48.20,0:05:49.36,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ツムギ…
Dialogue: 4,0:05:50.63,0:05:53.95,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「今日から 島の学校に通うことになった]
Dialogue: 4,0:05:54.42,0:05:58.96,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「みんな私の目の色や髪の色を見てざわざわしている」
Dialogue: 4,0:05:58.96,0:06:02.66,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「だから　私の友達はぬいぐるみだけです」
Dialogue: 4,0:06:03.31,0:06:04.42,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ぬいぐるみ…
Dialogue: 4,0:06:06.40,0:06:07.38,Text JP - Tsumugi,,700,0,0,,あれって…
Dialogue: 4,0:06:08.17,0:06:11.72,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「今日も皆さん私に話しかけてきません」
Dialogue: 4,0:06:11.72,0:06:13.81,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「たぶん怖がられています」
Dialogue: 4,0:06:14.23,0:06:16.93,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「ナマハゲ的なものだと思われています」
Dialogue: 4,0:06:17.29,0:06:20.85,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,700,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「だから　勇気を出して声をかけてみようと思います」
Dialogue: 4,0:06:22.50,0:06:24.02,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「ナマハゲ的に」
Dialogue: 4,0:06:24.02,0:06:26.38,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「泣くごはいねが～」
Dialogue: 4,0:06:26.38,0:06:28.40,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「悪いごはいねが～」
Dialogue: 4,0:06:28.40,0:06:31.94,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「親の言うこど聞がね子はいねが～」
Dialogue: 4,0:06:39.51,0:06:41.17,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「はずしました」
Dialogue: 4,0:06:57.76,0:07:01.15,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「お友達ができました　加藤さんといって」
Dialogue: 4,0:07:01.15,0:07:05.15,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「ぬいぐるみに興味のある子です　ちょっとうれしかった」
Dialogue: 4,0:07:05.64,0:07:07.53,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,よかったな　紬
Dialogue: 4,0:07:07.91,0:07:11.30,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,友達もたくさんできて　島にも慣れて
Dialogue: 4,0:07:11.30,0:07:13.08,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,明るく暮らしてるみたいね
Dialogue: 4,0:07:14.49,0:07:15.26,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬
Dialogue: 4,0:07:15.60,0:07:17.68,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,灯台守の人と駆け落ちするみたい
Dialogue: 4,0:07:17.68,0:07:18.66,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,えぇ～!?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:29.23,0:07:33.31,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「私はあの人と　この島を出ることにしました」
Dialogue: 4,0:07:33.31,0:07:35.18,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「今日灯台で待ち合わせて」
Dialogue: 4,0:07:35.92,0:07:38.92,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「お父さん　お母さん　ごめんなさい」
Dialogue: 4,0:07:38.92,0:07:41.81,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「島のみんな　今までありがとう」
Dialogue: 4,0:07:42.47,0:07:43.94,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\3c&H353535&}「大好きです」
Dialogue: 4,0:07:45.35,0:07:47.02,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,もしかして嫉妬してる？
Dialogue: 4,0:07:47.02,0:07:48.07,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,してる
Dialogue: 4,0:07:48.07,0:07:49.56,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,いさぎがいいわね
Dialogue: 4,0:07:49.56,0:07:52.34,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,で　でも　そもそもここに書かれてることって
Dialogue: 4,0:07:52.34,0:07:54.16,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,何十年も前のことなんだし…
Dialogue: 4,0:07:54.91,0:07:56.12,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,駆け落ち…
Dialogue: 4,0:07:57.48,0:08:00.84,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,神隠しって　こういうことだったのかしらね？
Dialogue: 4,0:08:00.84,0:08:02.68,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,いや　違うよ
Dialogue: 4,0:08:02.68,0:08:05.43,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,駄菓子屋のおばあちゃんが言ってたじゃないか
Dialogue: 4,0:08:05.43,0:08:09.27,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,灯台守の男の人も　消えた女の子を捜してたって
Dialogue: 4,0:08:09.27,0:08:11.66,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,じゃあ　本当に神隠しに？
Dialogue: 4,0:08:13.34,0:08:14.08,Text JP - Tsumugi,,800,0,0,,まさか…
Dialogue: 4,0:08:15.24,0:08:16.60,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,俺たちの紬も？
Dialogue: 4,0:08:21.01,0:08:23.04,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,この日記続きがあるわ
Dialogue: 4,0:08:28.78,0:08:30.28,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,なにこれ…
Dialogue: 4,0:08:38.30,0:08:39.16,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,これって
Dialogue: 4,0:08:46.62,0:08:48.63,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,私怖い…
Dialogue: 4,0:08:49.35,0:08:50.24,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,靜久
Dialogue: 4,0:08:50.98,0:08:54.76,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,捜せば捜すほど　調べれば調べるほど
Dialogue: 4,0:08:55.42,0:08:58.60,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,このまま紬に会えなくなっちゃう気がして…
Dialogue: 4,0:09:00.57,0:09:02.14,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ごめん　ここでいいかな
Dialogue: 4,0:09:02.50,0:09:03.49,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ハイリくん？
Dialogue: 4,0:09:03.49,0:09:05.84,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,俺　ちょっと寄ってくところがあるから
Dialogue: 4,0:09:22.11,0:09:24.04,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,お前たちも留守番か
Dialogue: 4,0:09:24.89,0:09:25.60,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,俺もだ
Dialogue: 4,0:09:26.05,0:09:28.12,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,今の俺にできることは
Dialogue: 4,0:09:28.12,0:09:31.28,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬が帰ってくるのを　ここでただ待つことだけだ
Dialogue: 4,0:09:31.96,0:09:32.55,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,だから
Dialogue: 4,0:09:33.40,0:09:34.00,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,だから…
Dialogue: 4,0:09:34.91,0:09:35.82,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬…
Dialogue: 4,0:09:38.20,0:09:38.54,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,えっ
Dialogue: 4,0:09:38.88,0:09:39.41,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}ええっ!?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:49.96,0:09:50.74,Text JP,,0,0,0,,ここは…
Dialogue: 4,0:09:52.56,0:09:55.08,Text JP,,0,0,0,,紬の部屋…　じゃない
Dialogue: 4,0:10:02.19,0:10:03.74,Text JP,,0,0,0,,なんだ…　これ？
Dialogue: 4,0:10:05.08,0:10:06.82,Text JP,,0,0,0,,ど　どこだ？　ここ!?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:11.48,0:10:12.65,Text JP,,0,0,0,,開かない？
Dialogue: 4,0:10:12.65,0:10:13.38,Text JP,,0,0,0,,クソッ
Dialogue: 4,0:10:25.13,0:10:25.80,Text JP,,0,0,0,,なんで!?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:26.59,0:10:27.96,Text JP,,0,0,0,,昇ってたよな俺？
Dialogue: 4,0:10:37.96,0:10:39.49,Text JP,,0,0,0,,どうなってるんだ？
Dialogue: 4,0:10:39.49,0:10:40.50,Text JP,,0,0,0,,どなたですか？
Dialogue: 4,0:10:45.43,0:10:46.15,Text JP,,0,0,0,,あの…
Dialogue: 4,0:10:47.50,0:10:48.75,Text JP,,0,0,0,,紬！
Dialogue: 4,0:10:48.75,0:10:49.93,Text JP,,0,0,0,,どこにいたんだ？
Dialogue: 4,0:10:49.93,0:10:51.62,Text JP,,0,0,0,,心配してたんだぞ！
Dialogue: 4,0:10:51.62,0:10:54.17,Text JP,,0,0,0,,私ならずっとここにいましたが…
Dialogue: 4,0:10:54.17,0:10:55.56,Text JP,,0,0,0,,ここに？
Dialogue: 4,0:10:55.56,0:10:59.05,Text JP,,0,0,0,,だってお前　捜したけど全然見つからなくて…
Dialogue: 4,0:11:00.87,0:11:03.09,Text JP,,0,0,0,,紬…　だよな？
Dialogue: 4,0:11:03.09,0:11:07.29,Text JP,,0,0,0,,はい　確かに私はツムギ・ヴェンダースです
Dialogue: 4,0:11:14.42,0:11:16.56,Text JP,,0,0,0,,泣くごはいねが～
Dialogue: 4,0:11:17.19,0:11:19.32,Text JP,,0,0,0,,悪いごはいねが～！
Dialogue: 4,0:11:19.32,0:11:22.84,Text JP,,0,0,0,,親の言うこど聞がね子はいねが～！
Dialogue: 4,0:11:22.84,0:11:26.12,Text JP,,0,0,0,,ど　どうして私の鉄板自己紹介を？
Dialogue: 4,0:11:26.72,0:11:27.66,Text JP,,0,0,0,,ウソだろ…
Dialogue: 4,0:11:28.84,0:11:31.06,Text JP,,0,0,0,,俺も…　神隠しに？
Dialogue: 4,0:11:38.84,0:11:40.84,Text JP,,0,0,0,,帰りた～い！
Dialogue: 4,0:11:41.26,0:11:45.18,Text JP,,0,0,0,,ものすっご～く帰りた～い！
Dialogue: 4,0:11:45.54,0:11:47.57,Text JP,,0,0,0,,本当にこれで帰れるの？
Dialogue: 4,0:11:47.57,0:11:50.56,Text JP,,0,0,0,,他の皆さんはそうだったみたいです
Dialogue: 4,0:11:50.56,0:11:54.76,Text JP,,0,0,0,,私は帰ったことがないので　本当のところはわかりません
Dialogue: 4,0:11:56.36,0:11:57.90,Text JP,,0,0,0,,残念ですが
Dialogue: 4,0:11:57.90,0:12:02.04,Text JP,,0,0,0,,ここの何かに囚われている人は　ここからは出られません
Dialogue: 4,0:12:02.90,0:12:04.16,Text JP,,0,0,0,,ずっとずっと
Dialogue: 4,0:12:04.62,0:12:09.24,Text JP,,0,0,0,,何に囚われているかも忘れてしまうくらい　長い時間…
Dialogue: 4,0:12:09.24,0:12:10.83,Text JP,,0,0,0,,囚われてるって
Dialogue: 4,0:12:11.34,0:12:12.52,Text JP,,0,0,0,,じゃあ　君も…
Dialogue: 4,0:12:15.02,0:12:16.86,Text JP,,0,0,0,,そんなに似てるんですか？
Dialogue: 4,0:12:17.50,0:12:19.78,Text JP,,0,0,0,,私とその…
Dialogue: 4,0:12:19.78,0:12:20.84,Text JP,,0,0,0,,紬さん？
Dialogue: 4,0:12:21.75,0:12:22.35,Text JP,,0,0,0,,ああ
Dialogue: 4,0:12:23.02,0:12:25.64,Text JP,,0,0,0,,ビックリするくらい瓜二つで
Dialogue: 4,0:12:25.64,0:12:28.28,Text JP,,0,0,0,,でも雰囲気は全然違うかな
Dialogue: 4,0:12:28.28,0:12:31.82,Text JP,,0,0,0,,にぎやかで　こう思い込んだらまっすぐで…
Dialogue: 4,0:12:31.82,0:12:33.96,Text JP,,0,0,0,,だから目が離せないっていうか
Dialogue: 4,0:12:33.96,0:12:35.36,Text JP,,0,0,0,,そうですか…
Dialogue: 4,0:12:35.36,0:12:37.27,Text JP,,0,0,0,,早く帰れるといいですね
Dialogue: 4,0:12:40.01,0:12:42.64,Text JP,,0,0,0,,鷹原さんの気持ちはよくわかります
Dialogue: 4,0:12:43.72,0:12:49.98,Text JP,,0,0,0,,私も恋人と大好きなお友達ともずっと離れ離れですから
Dialogue: 4,0:12:49.98,0:12:51.94,Text JP,,0,0,0,,それって駆け落ちの…
Dialogue: 4,0:12:54.36,0:12:57.83,Text JP,,0,0,0,,私は　あのとき選べませんでした
Dialogue: 4,0:12:59.18,0:13:01.96,Text JP,,0,0,0,,怖くなったんです私…
Dialogue: 4,0:13:06.39,0:13:08.38,Text JP,,0,0,0,,愛する人と生きるために
Dialogue: 4,0:13:08.75,0:13:11.27,Text JP,,0,0,0,,両親や島の友達を
Dialogue: 4,0:13:11.27,0:13:14.32,Text JP,,0,0,0,,すべてを捨てるって　決めたのに
Dialogue: 4,0:13:15.32,0:13:16.65,Text JP,,0,0,0,,結局迷って
Dialogue: 4,0:13:17.81,0:13:19.90,Text JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,920)}選べなかった…
Dialogue: 4,0:13:24.28,0:13:27.52,Text JP,,0,0,0,,それで　気がついたらここに来ていました
Dialogue: 4,0:13:28.21,0:13:32.14,Text JP,,0,0,0,,今もまだ　迷い続けてるんだと思います
Dialogue: 4,0:13:32.14,0:13:33.20,Text JP,,0,0,0,,ツムギさん…
Dialogue: 4,0:13:33.52,0:13:38.24,Text JP,,0,0,0,,でも　鷹原さんは会いたい人を求めてここに迷い込んだんでしょう？
Dialogue: 4,0:13:38.24,0:13:41.44,Text JP,,0,0,0,,だったら　その人のことを強く思えば
Dialogue: 4,0:13:41.44,0:13:43.98,Text JP,,0,0,0,,きっと元の世界に戻れると思います
Dialogue: 4,0:13:44.79,0:13:46.62,Text JP,,0,0,0,,強く思えば…
Dialogue: 4,0:13:47.09,0:13:50.30,Text JP,,0,0,0,,信じてあげてください　恋人さんのことを
Dialogue: 4,0:13:52.15,0:13:53.26,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\t(200,600,\shad3)\3c&HD2811E&\t(200,600,\3c&H41B931&)}そうだ
Dialogue: 4,0:13:53.68,0:13:55.64,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬が何者だろうと
Dialogue: 4,0:13:55.99,0:13:57.69,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,どんな過去があろうと
Dialogue: 4,0:13:58.03,0:13:59.72,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そんなの関係ない
Dialogue: 4,0:14:00.23,0:14:02.69,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,今はただ　紬に会いたい
Dialogue: 4,0:14:03.43,0:14:05.03,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あの笑顔を見たい
Dialogue: 4,0:14:05.60,0:14:07.38,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あの歌を聴きたい…
Dialogue: 4,0:14:12.62,0:14:14.23,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,その歌…
Dialogue: 4,0:14:15.18,0:14:16.16,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,懐かしい
Dialogue: 4,0:14:22.01,0:14:22.74,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,風…
Dialogue: 4,0:14:24.80,0:14:26.80,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,出口があるのかも！　ツムギさん！
Dialogue: 4,0:14:28.48,0:14:30.90,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,迷い続けている私が行ったら
Dialogue: 4,0:14:30.90,0:14:33.26,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,出口はきっと消えてしまいます
Dialogue: 4,0:14:33.70,0:14:35.91,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,鷹原さんだけ　行ってください
Dialogue: 4,0:14:35.91,0:14:36.60,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,でも！
Dialogue: 4,0:14:41.15,0:14:44.77,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬さんのこと　大切にしてあげてください
Dialogue: 4,0:14:47.26,0:14:47.84,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 4,0:14:48.41,0:14:49.04,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ありがとう
Dialogue: 4,0:14:51.82,0:14:54.28,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そんなところで何してるんだ～？
Dialogue: 4,0:14:54.68,0:14:57.11,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,探し物で～す！
Dialogue: 4,0:14:57.11,0:14:59.04,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,何探してるの？
Dialogue: 4,0:14:59.43,0:15:01.42,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,自分で～す！
Dialogue: 4,0:15:01.60,0:15:02.34,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬…
Dialogue: 4,0:15:03.23,0:15:05.40,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,お前が探してた自分って
Dialogue: 4,0:15:06.18,0:15:06.90,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,もしかして…
Dialogue: 4,0:15:16.74,0:15:17.64,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,これは…
Dialogue: 4,0:15:35.42,0:15:37.67,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,パリングルスは無敵
Dialogue: 4,0:15:37.67,0:15:38.36,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,だよな
Dialogue: 4,0:15:40.04,0:15:40.86,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬…
Dialogue: 4,0:15:44.28,0:15:45.16,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里くん！
Dialogue: 4,0:15:45.66,0:15:46.56,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里くん！
Dialogue: 4,0:15:47.20,0:15:48.21,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里くん！
Dialogue: 4,0:15:51.30,0:15:52.36,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,羽依里くん！
Dialogue: 4,0:15:56.34,0:15:57.28,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,もう！！
Dialogue: 4,0:15:57.28,0:15:59.00,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,どこに行ってたのよ!?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:59.00,0:16:00.18,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,靜久…
Dialogue: 4,0:16:00.84,0:16:02.89,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬がいなくなって
Dialogue: 4,0:16:02.89,0:16:05.03,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あなたまでいなくなったら
Dialogue: 4,0:16:05.03,0:16:07.65,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,私どうしたらいいかわからないじゃない！
Dialogue: 4,0:16:08.77,0:16:09.60,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ごめん…
Dialogue: 4,0:16:11.49,0:16:12.10,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬は!?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:13.95,0:16:15.42,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ハ　ハイリ…
Dialogue: 4,0:16:17.34,0:16:18.80,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,よがっだ…
Dialogue: 4,0:16:18.80,0:16:22.13,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,よがっだでずぅ　ハイリざん…
Dialogue: 4,0:16:22.13,0:16:23.06,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬…
Dialogue: 4,0:16:24.59,0:16:27.17,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ハイリくんと別れた翌日よ
Dialogue: 4,0:16:27.50,0:16:31.98,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,もしかしたら紬が帰ってくるかもと思って　灯台で待ってたら…
Dialogue: 4,0:16:36.15,0:16:37.29,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,シズク
Dialogue: 4,0:16:37.90,0:16:38.71,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あの…
Dialogue: 4,0:16:39.14,0:16:39.70,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ!?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:40.16,0:16:40.78,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬
Dialogue: 4,0:16:40.78,0:16:41.20,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬
Dialogue: 4,0:16:41.20,0:16:41.64,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬
Dialogue: 4,0:16:41.64,0:16:43.52,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬～！
Dialogue: 4,0:16:44.41,0:16:49.48,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,でも　紬と入れ替わりで　今度はハイリくんがいなくなって
Dialogue: 4,0:16:50.09,0:16:51.54,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ホント心配したのよ
Dialogue: 4,0:16:52.16,0:16:52.92,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ごめん…
Dialogue: 4,0:16:54.33,0:16:56.86,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,よがっだ…　です
Dialogue: 4,0:16:57.37,0:16:58.20,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬…
Dialogue: 4,0:16:59.50,0:17:00.34,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ！
Dialogue: 4,0:17:01.57,0:17:02.79,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬…
Dialogue: 4,0:17:02.79,0:17:04.76,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ダ…　ダメでず
Dialogue: 4,0:17:04.76,0:17:08.18,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,涙とか鼻水とか　ついちゃいまずぅ
Dialogue: 4,0:17:09.07,0:17:10.09,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,大丈夫…
Dialogue: 4,0:17:13.39,0:17:14.34,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,じゃあ
Dialogue: 4,0:17:14.34,0:17:17.34,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,もうちょっと　こうしててほしいでず
Dialogue: 4,0:17:17.83,0:17:20.22,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,まったく…　2人とも
Dialogue: 4,0:17:20.63,0:17:21.64,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,2人とも…
Dialogue: 4,0:17:30.84,0:17:33.57,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,丸一日　俺がいなくなって？
Dialogue: 4,0:17:33.57,0:17:34.81,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そうよ
Dialogue: 4,0:17:34.81,0:17:36.75,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,いったいどこに行ってたの？
Dialogue: 4,0:17:36.75,0:17:37.91,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,どこって…
Dialogue: 4,0:17:37.91,0:17:39.03,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,それは…
Dialogue: 4,0:17:42.08,0:17:44.16,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,覚えて…　ない
Dialogue: 4,0:17:44.16,0:17:45.07,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ？
Dialogue: 4,0:17:45.07,0:17:46.08,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,どういうこと？
Dialogue: 4,0:17:46.08,0:17:47.22,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ホントなんだ
Dialogue: 4,0:17:48.15,0:17:49.50,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,何も覚えて…
Dialogue: 4,0:17:52.99,0:17:53.72,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ？
Dialogue: 4,0:17:59.30,0:18:01.68,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,覚えてないなら仕方ないわね
Dialogue: 4,0:18:04.25,0:18:05.43,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,おかえりなさい
Dialogue: 4,0:18:05.43,0:18:06.30,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,えっと
Dialogue: 4,0:18:07.25,0:18:09.39,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,本当にすみませんでした
Dialogue: 4,0:18:09.39,0:18:10.94,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,すみませんでした
Dialogue: 4,0:18:11.60,0:18:14.14,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,いろいろ心配しちゃったけど
Dialogue: 4,0:18:14.14,0:18:15.68,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,元気ならそれでいいわ
Dialogue: 4,0:18:17.41,0:18:18.26,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あの…
Dialogue: 4,0:18:18.26,0:18:19.20,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,うみちゃんは？
Dialogue: 4,0:18:19.51,0:18:22.00,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,心配疲れで寝ちゃったわ
Dialogue: 4,0:18:22.00,0:18:24.20,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,明日の朝謝ってあげてね
Dialogue: 4,0:18:24.20,0:18:25.40,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,はい…
Dialogue: 4,0:18:25.40,0:18:28.08,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,紬ちゃん　今日はもう遅いから
Dialogue: 4,0:18:28.08,0:18:29.40,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,うちに泊まっていったら？
Dialogue: 4,0:18:30.73,0:18:31.86,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ…
Dialogue: 4,0:18:42.60,0:18:43.50,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ハイリさん
Dialogue: 4,0:18:44.73,0:18:46.20,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,入ってもいいですか？
Dialogue: 4,0:18:47.80,0:18:48.28,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 4,0:18:48.86,0:18:49.44,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,どうぞ
Dialogue: 4,0:18:54.81,0:18:57.60,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,少し　お話ししてもいいですか？
Dialogue: 4,0:19:02.62,0:19:03.34,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あの…
Dialogue: 4,0:19:04.06,0:19:07.28,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,私　帰るって言いましたけど
Dialogue: 4,0:19:07.96,0:19:12.82,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,それって　故郷に帰る　とかじゃなくて…
Dialogue: 4,0:19:13.58,0:19:14.48,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,えっと
Dialogue: 4,0:19:15.72,0:19:16.62,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,その…
Dialogue: 4,0:19:17.32,0:19:19.40,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,む　むぎゅ…
Dialogue: 4,0:19:19.90,0:19:21.00,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,なあ　紬
Dialogue: 4,0:19:21.51,0:19:25.08,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,その話　俺聞いても聞かなくてもいいんだ
Dialogue: 4,0:19:26.44,0:19:27.92,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,決めたから
Dialogue: 4,0:19:27.92,0:19:31.72,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,最後の一瞬まで　紬と一緒にいるって
Dialogue: 4,0:19:31.72,0:19:33.06,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そう決めたから
Dialogue: 4,0:19:33.38,0:19:37.78,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,何を言っても　何も言わなくても　一緒にいる
Dialogue: 4,0:19:39.79,0:19:41.07,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ハイリさん…
Dialogue: 4,0:19:45.51,0:19:49.11,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あなたと　ずっと一緒にいたいです
Dialogue: 4,0:19:49.11,0:19:50.76,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,最後まで…
Dialogue: 4,0:19:50.76,0:19:51.96,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,お願いします
Dialogue: 4,0:19:51.96,0:19:52.70,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 4,0:19:54.74,0:19:57.96,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,俺も　紬に言わなきゃならないことがある
Dialogue: 4,0:19:58.46,0:20:01.36,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,俺　ツムギ・ヴェンダースさんに会ったんだ
Dialogue: 4,0:20:02.48,0:20:04.96,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,自分がどこにいたかは覚えてないけど
Dialogue: 4,0:20:05.62,0:20:06.98,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,それだけは覚えてる
Dialogue: 4,0:20:07.82,0:20:09.72,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,忘れちゃいけない気がするんだ
Dialogue: 4,0:20:10.22,0:20:11.18,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あの…
Dialogue: 4,0:20:11.18,0:20:14.17,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ツムギちゃんお元気そうでしたか？
Dialogue: 4,0:20:14.17,0:20:14.62,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 4,0:20:15.03,0:20:16.47,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,元気そうだったよ
Dialogue: 4,0:20:16.47,0:20:17.77,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そですか
Dialogue: 4,0:20:17.77,0:20:18.90,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,よかったです
Dialogue: 4,0:20:20.04,0:20:20.90,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あのさ
Dialogue: 4,0:20:21.18,0:20:25.32,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ずっと紬が探してた「自分」って　あの子のこと？
Dialogue: 4,0:20:25.32,0:20:26.12,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 4,0:20:26.12,0:20:27.41,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ツムギちゃんです
Dialogue: 4,0:20:29.32,0:20:32.66,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,夏が終わったら　あの子のところに行くのか
Dialogue: 4,0:20:32.94,0:20:34.32,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そですね…
Dialogue: 4,0:20:34.32,0:20:37.06,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ハイリさんが見つけてくれたおかげで
Dialogue: 4,0:20:37.06,0:20:41.56,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,私はツムギちゃんの元にちゃんと帰ることができそうです
Dialogue: 4,0:20:41.56,0:20:44.30,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,すごく寂しがってると思うので
Dialogue: 4,0:20:44.30,0:20:45.30,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,よかったです
Dialogue: 4,0:20:46.81,0:20:47.78,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,困ったな…
Dialogue: 4,0:20:49.21,0:20:51.81,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そうなると　俺も寂しい…
Dialogue: 4,0:20:53.42,0:20:54.96,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,むぎゅ～
Dialogue: 4,0:20:54.96,0:20:57.52,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,わ　わがまま言わないでください
Dialogue: 4,0:20:57.52,0:20:59.69,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,私だって寂しいですし
Dialogue: 4,0:20:59.69,0:21:04.00,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,そんなこと言われると　すっごく困っちゃいます
Dialogue: 4,0:21:05.29,0:21:06.66,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あっ　そうだ
Dialogue: 4,0:21:08.80,0:21:09.99,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,これ　紬に
Dialogue: 4,0:21:13.76,0:21:15.75,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,静久が言うにはさ
Dialogue: 4,0:21:15.75,0:21:19.71,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,好きな子に気持ちを伝えるのは　プレゼントが一番だって
Dialogue: 4,0:21:19.71,0:21:22.25,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,さすがシズクです
Dialogue: 4,0:21:22.25,0:21:24.68,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,あの　つけてもいいですか？
Dialogue: 4,0:21:24.68,0:21:25.30,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,もちろん
Dialogue: 4,0:21:33.00,0:21:34.02,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,どうでしょう？
Dialogue: 4,0:21:35.27,0:21:36.18,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,似合ってる
Dialogue: 4,0:21:38.08,0:21:42.44,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,ちゃんと　伝わってきます　ハイリさんの気持ち…
Dialogue: 4,0:22:01.90,0:22:05.50,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,8月31日まで　あと1週間
Dialogue: 4,0:22:06.42,0:22:09.82,Text JP - Tsumugi,,0,0,0,,俺たちの夏休みが　終わろうとしていた
